A NOTE ON THE CONTENTS

  These decks contain no third-party figures. They are text, tables, and
  ASCII diagrams, so redistributing or adapting them raises no image-licensing
  questions -- and nothing in them is encumbered by a license incompatible
  with ShareAlike.

  They cite published work extensively. Citations are references, not
  reproductions -- the cited papers carry their own licenses, and nothing here
  grants any right over them. Where a deck quotes a reported figure or dataset
  statistic, that fact is attributed to its source on the slide or in the
  references slide.

  If you add third-party figures to an adaptation, check that their licenses
  are compatible with CC BY-SA 4.0 before you distribute it. Externally
  sourced figures used elsewhere in this repository are catalogued with their
  individual licenses in assets/images/external/ATTRIBUTION.md; none of them
  appear in these decks.


NO WARRANTY

  Provided as-is. The material describes a field that moves quickly; figures,
  dataset sizes, and "state of the field" claims are accurate as of the last
  revision date on each deck and will age. Verify before relying on a specific
  number in your own work.
